        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "\"Bleed 2 is a relentless arcade action game about shooting, dodging, reflecting bullets, slowing time, and lots and lots of bosses. The player controls a young girl named Wryn -- the world's greatest (and only remaining) hero. Together, they must battle an invading force of villains and live up to her title as the Greatest Hero of All Time!\"",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "«Bleed 2 es un juego de arcade frenético sobre disparar, esquivar, reflejar balas, ralentizar el tiempo y montones de jefes. El jugador controla a una joven llamada Wryn, la mayor heroína del mundo (y la única que queda). Juntas deben combatir a una fuerza invasora de villanos y estar a la altura de su título de la Mayor Heroína de Todos los Tiempos.»",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2017",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
